  "notes": "{刺|さ}さる means for something sharp to pierce and remain stuck in place.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{刺|さ}す→刺す：02111_sasu⟧ (transitive, to stab/pierce)\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{刺|さ}さって⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ describes the state of being stuck in something.\n- ⟦ナイフ→ナイフ：01039_naifu⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{刺|さ}さって⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧: A knife is stuck (in something)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦とげ→棘：13134_toge⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{指|ゆび}→指：01518_yubi⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{刺|さ}さる: a thorn gets stuck in one's finger\n- ⟦{針|はり}→針：03566_hari⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{刺|さ}さる: a needle gets stuck\n- ⟦{心|こころ}→心：01321_kokoro⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{刺|さ}さる: to strike a chord (figurative)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{突|つ}き{刺|さ}さる→突き刺さる：20293_tsukisasaru⟧: to pierce through\n- ⟦{刺|さ}す→刺す：02111_sasu⟧: to stab, poke, sting",
